  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Pat Toutou (also written "Pat'toutou") is a dog and cat grooming salon at 4 avenue Général Mangin, in Hyères (Var). It is listed at the same address and with the same number by Wamiz, Cylex, Justacoté and Mappy.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Hours given by Wamiz and Cylex: Tuesday to Saturday from 10am to 5pm, closed on Sunday and Monday. Mappy shows much wider ranges (from 6am to midnight), manifestly wrong: confirm by phone on 04 94 65 64 26 before coming with your dog. No official website for the salon was found, and the directories give neither prices nor appointment arrangements.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming to book an appointment and confirm the hours.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The centre of Hyères is easily reached from avenue Général Mangin, with the medieval old town and its ramparts nearby, as well as the Giens peninsula and its beaches a little further on to extend the day with your dog.</p>
